# MID-15: two inputs send MIDI clock (USB 0 and Bluetooth 1, the 4th field of midi). X0X follows one input.
# The first input with Clock, Start or Continue gets the clock. The other input is ignored until the first
# input sends nothing for 0.4 s, or until 0.4 s after its Stop. INTERNAL ignores both inputs.
wait 300
expect clksrc 0
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
tapkey w8
tapkey w12
# both inputs send Start in the same millisecond: the first in the queue (Bluetooth) wins
midi FA 00 00 1
midi FA 00 00 0
midi FC 00 00 0
wait 10
expect playing 1
# both inputs send clock at 119 BPM, interleaved: X0X counts one input (119 BPM, not 238)
midi F8 00 00 1
wait 10
midi F8 00 00 0
wait 11
midi F8 00 00 1
wait 10
midi F8 00 00 0
wait 11
